  Content: "\"Inner Space \u2013 Outer Space\"\nBasia Hinton\nLarge-scale paintings
    on African bark cloth explore cosmic and earthly connections. Viewers are invited
    to float above wild roses, mushrooms, and stars in a macrocosmic dreamscape.\n"
  RavenSucessScript: "\u201CYou soared through bark cloth cosmos. Stars, spores,
    and dreams\u2014nicely done, stargazer.\u201D"
  RavenHintScript: "\u201CCollect every stamp to unlock the secret finale. Trust
    me\u2014it\u2019s worth the squawk.\u201D\n"
